Throw them all away, let me hold you at last

867
01:02:15,693 --> 01:02:17,553
My lovely prisoner

868
01:02:17,633 --> 01:02:18,573
What’s the matter?

869
01:02:18,653 --> 01:02:22,373
You’re never leaving, you are mine forever

870
01:02:22,553 --> 01:02:23,853
Got to keep you right here

871
01:02:24,013 --> 01:02:25,953
Poor, helpless prisoner

872
01:02:26,293 --> 01:02:27,253
Did you shatter?

873
01:02:27,393 --> 01:02:31,093
Why are you grieving your ambitions? Let them disappear

874
01:02:31,413 --> 01:02:35,313
I can hear your plea, reaching desperately, but I’ll never, ever set you free

875
01:02:35,593 --> 01:02:36,693
Stay with me...

876
01:02:54,813 --> 01:02:56,673
My lovely prisoner

877
01:02:56,753 --> 01:02:57,653
Are you shaking?

878
01:02:58,033 --> 01:03:02,213
My eyes will find you, let me clutch you tightly

879
01:03:02,293 --> 01:03:03,693
You can only be mine

880
01:03:03,893 --> 01:03:06,173
Poor little prisoner

881
01:03:06,293 --> 01:03:07,193
Are you breaking?

882
01:03:07,573 --> 01:03:10,673
My chains will bind you here forever,

883
01:03:11,113 --> 01:03:14,593
Stay here for all time

884
01:03:14,913 --> 01:03:15,813
In tenebris

885
01:03:16,313 --> 01:03:17,193
in frigore

886
01:03:18,053 --> 01:03:18,953
in carcere

887
01:03:26,391 --> 01:03:27,431
Yeah!

888
01:03:27,431 --> 01:03:30,791
That was our new song, "Prisoner"!

889
01:03:31,031 --> 01:03:35,491
What did you think of the track, huh? Hot song, huh? Yeah!

890
01:03:36,071 --> 01:03:42,331
Okay, and let's all move on to the second piece of exciting news, getting close, girls!

891
01:03:42,331 --> 01:03:43,211
Yeah!

892
01:03:43,501 --> 01:03:53,951
Hololive English Advent 2nd Anniversary Celebration!

893
01:03:54,181 --> 01:04:00,031
First up, we have the framed art board.

894
01:04:00,031 --> 01:04:05,671
It's a large illustration board framed beautifully.

895
01:04:05,671 --> 01:04:17,051
The luxurious frame features our logo with foil stamping for the extra shine. It's a perfect item to decorate your home and to enjoy looking at every single day,

896
01:04:17,051 --> 01:04:20,271
so you can see all of us together, just like we should be.

897
01:04:20,271 --> 01:04:26,931
Well, next up, we have a sticker set from 2024 Halloween version!

898
01:04:27,601 --> 01:04:35,081
Five different designs, and it includes the VR Chat design released for Halloween,

899
01:04:35,081 --> 01:04:40,561
plus a three-piece sticker set featuring each Advent member's original design.

900
01:04:40,561 --> 01:04:44,981
And then you can put them on your phone, stick them on your PC, and have fun with them!

901
01:04:44,981 --> 01:04:46,521
Yeah!

902
01:04:46,521 --> 01:04:52,421
All right, next up, we got the connecting charm!

903
01:04:52,841 --> 01:04:56,721
With all these charms that can actually connect!

904
01:04:56,721 --> 01:04:59,561
What's awesome is that all these charms can actually connect!

905
01:05:00,276 --> 01:05:01,036
So,

906
01:05:01,036 --> 01:05:01,936
choose each other,

907
01:05:01,936 --> 01:05:05,076
you can mix and match for all kinds of different ways, right?

908
01:05:05,196 --> 01:05:06,116
And have fun!

909
01:05:06,116 --> 01:05:06,836
Yeah!

910
01:05:09,276 --> 01:05:12,016
Finally, we've got the Varsity Jacket!

911
01:05:12,256 --> 01:05:12,836
Wow!

912
01:05:13,036 --> 01:05:15,176
It's got the Advent logo on the back,

913
01:05:15,176 --> 01:05:16,972
and Poki is embroidered

914
01:05:16,972 --> 01:05:19,136
on the front test day, too!

915
01:05:19,176 --> 01:05:19,636
Wow!

916
01:05:20,976 --> 01:05:22,196
And guess what?

917
01:05:22,376 --> 01:05:22,956
What?

918
01:05:22,956 --> 01:05:24,476
You can actually attach those charms

919
01:05:24,476 --> 01:05:26,476
I just showed you

920
01:05:26,476 --> 01:05:28,276
on the zipper of the jacket, too!

921
01:05:29,526 --> 01:05:31,872
You know, it's a cool item that you can rock

922
01:05:31,872 --> 01:05:34,386
both in your everyday life and at events, too!

923
01:05:34,386 --> 01:05:34,966
Yeah!

924
01:05:34,966 --> 01:05:35,566
Yeah!

925
01:05:35,906 --> 01:05:36,606
And guess what?

926
01:05:36,806 --> 01:05:37,546
What?

927
01:05:37,546 --> 01:05:40,146
It's happening right now!

928
01:05:40,146 --> 01:05:43,966
The merch just dropped at the Hololive Official Shop!

929
01:05:44,406 --> 01:05:44,946
Now!

930
01:05:45,086 --> 01:05:47,672
Hey guys, notice that guy showing up on the bottom

931
01:05:47,672 --> 01:05:49,972
of the bottom left, left of the YouTube screen,

932
01:05:49,972 --> 01:05:51,972
go ahead and click it

933
01:05:51,972 --> 01:05:53,846
to shop your favorites, okay?

934
01:05:58,706 --> 01:06:00,472
This was such a wonderful day together.

935
01:06:00,472 --> 01:06:02,286
We had so much fun!

936
01:06:02,426 --> 01:06:04,372
You guys probably were running

937
01:06:04,372 --> 01:06:06,306
