938
01:06:06,506 --> 01:06:07,306
Yeah, but that's typical Friday.

939
01:06:07,306 --> 01:06:08,686
Were we really worried?

940
01:06:08,846 --> 01:06:11,566
No, better luck next time, Justice.

941
01:06:11,566 --> 01:06:13,406
As if you could ever catch us!

942
01:06:13,406 --> 01:06:15,206
We are sentinels!

943
01:06:15,206 --> 01:06:16,586
Yeah! Don't forget that!

944
01:06:16,586 --> 01:06:18,226
We've been together for two years now!

945
01:06:18,326 --> 01:06:19,166
Can you believe it?

946
01:06:19,626 --> 01:06:21,206
Lots of memories.

947
01:06:21,206 --> 01:06:23,472
Yeah, lots of memories,

948
01:06:23,472 --> 01:06:24,572
and we're looking forward

949
01:06:24,572 --> 01:06:25,746
to all of the next years together.

950
01:06:26,026 --> 01:06:26,726
Year three!

951
01:06:26,726 --> 01:06:27,426
Year four!

952
01:06:27,426 --> 01:06:28,126
Year five!

953
01:06:28,126 --> 01:06:29,086
Year six!

954
01:06:29,086 --> 01:06:30,746
Yeah! Hell yeah!

955
01:06:30,746 --> 01:06:32,126
Together forever!

956
01:06:32,126 --> 01:06:33,326
Yes! Together forever!

957
01:06:33,566 --> 01:06:36,606
Bros before Riding Adventures!

958
01:06:36,726 --> 01:06:41,086
Bros before Riding Adventures!

